    26	   bytes and sha256 from a verification run: `coverage: complete` for that inventory, never a
    27	   whole-dataset claim beyond it); declared size in decimal GB under 20 GB and the summed inventory
    28	   bytes under the same cap; origin reachable at L2. Missing size, missing checksum, blocked origin,
    29	   restricted, forbidden or unknown rights each fail on their own.
    30	2. Storage transport is injected: `LocalDirectory` (slice 1, tests and dry runs) and `S3`
    31	   (slice 2, Hetzner, keys from repository secrets, only in the dispatched `verify` workflow on
    32	   `main`, never on pull-request runs). Layout `mirror/<record-id>/<sha256>/<filename>`; beside it
    33	   `custody/<sha256>.json` (the custody document) and `custody/<sha256>.removed.json` (tombstone).
    34	   Objects are public-read without listing; the public index is regenerated from the custody
    35	   documents at build time, never hand-written.
